    COPYING.LIB, LGPL-2.0 text with the mdbtools source headers'
    "version 2 or later" grant — the project is labelled
    LGPL-2.1-or-later). The full licence text ships verbatim in
    LICENSE-mdbtools in this directory. Upstream source:
    https://github.com/mdbtools/mdbtools

Local patches to the vendored sources (both needed because upstream
drops per-cell null-ness inside _mdb_attempt_bind; the EPTB missing
bitmap requires it):

  * include/mdbtools.h.in — added `unsigned char is_null;` to
    MdbColumn.
  * src/libmdb/data.c — `_mdb_attempt_bind` sets `col->is_null =
    isnull` before dispatching. For MDB_BOOL the JET null bit is the
    value, never missingness (handled in c/eptb.c).

c/codepages.c
    Single-byte code-page tables for windows-874 and
    windows-1250..windows-1258, generated from Python's `codecs`
    module (WHATWG single-byte index equivalents); 0 marks bytes the
    page leaves undefined.
